2 0 obj
<<
/Producer (PyPDF2)
/Title (k\040Joins\040on\040Complex\040Data\040Types)
/Author (Shuyao\040Qi\054\040Panagiotis\040Bouros\054\040Nikos\040Mamoulis)
/Subject (Consider\040two\040collections\040of\040objects\040R\040and\040S\054\040where\040each\040object\040is\040assigned\040a\040score\040\050e\056g\056\054\040a\040rating\051\056\040Given\040a\040join\040predicate\040and\040an\040integer\040k\054\040a\040top\055k\040join\040query\040returns\040the\040k\040pairs\040of\040objects\040which\040have\040the\040highest\040combined\040score\040\050based\040on\040an\040aggregate\040scoring\040function\040\051\040among\040all\040object\040pairs\040in\040R\040S\040that\040qualify\040\056\040This\040query\040type\040has\040been\040extensively\040studied\040in\040the\040relational\040database\040context\040where\040the\040join\040predicate\040is\040equality\054\040with\040the\040main\040goal\040of\040minimizing\040the\040number\040of\040tuples\040accessed\040from\040relations\040R\040and\040S\056\040However\054\040if\040the\040top\055k\040join\040involves\040a\040non\055equijoin\040predicate\040on\040complex\040data\040types\054\040the\040computational\040cost\040can\040easily\040become\040the\040bottleneck\040of\040query\040evaluation\056\040In\040view\040of\040this\054\040we\040propose\040a\040novel\040evaluation\040paradigm\040for\040top\055k\040joins\054\040which\040aims\040at\040minimizing\040the\040computations\040cost\054\040without\040compromising\040the\040access\040cost\056\040The\040main\040idea\040behind\040our\040paradigm\040is\040to\040examine\040blocks\040of\040data\040from\040R\040and\040S\040ordered\040by\040the\040object\040scores\073\040by\040performing\040the\040top\055k\040join\040in\040a\040block\055wise\040fashion\054\040we\040avoid\040\050i\051\040building\040expensive\040indexes\040incrementally\040and\040\050ii\051\040comparing\040pairs\040of\040blocks\040that\040may\040not\040contain\040results\040\050using\040appropriate\040bounds\051\056\040We\040show\040how\040our\040paradigm\040can\040be\040applied\040for\040the\040cases\040of\040top\055k\040spatial\040and\040string\040joins\040and\040conduct\040an\040analysis\040on\040how\040to\040derive\040the\040optimal\040block\040size\040for\040each\040case\056\040Finally\054\040we\040evaluate\040our\040proposal\040by\040extensive\040experimentation\040on\040both\040real\040and\040synthetic\040data\056)
/Keywords (01\040Jan\0402015\054\040Sort\055merge\040join\054\040Hash\040join\054\040Joins\054\040Tuple\054\040Predicate\040\050mathematical\040logic\051)
>>
